{"id":"en_rebirth-in-blood-and-moonlight","title":"Rebirth in Blood and Moonlight","titleEn":"Rebirth in Blood and Moonlight","description":"Emma Shawn, betrayed in a previous life, refuses to become a bride and instead embraces widowhood. She defies her merciless family and sets her wedding dress ablaze. Yet just as punishment is about to strike, General Oliver Sterling—believed dead—reappears bearing a royal decree. The question lingers: who is this woman actually grieving? And what explains the Emperor’s personal interest in watching their every step? Dramzio is where the series can be followed.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/rebirth-in-blood-and-moonlight/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/rebirth-in-blood-and-moonlight/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Clan Drama","Rebirth","Scumbag-punishing"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7di6tg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_rebirth-in-blood-and-moonlight_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7di6tg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_rebirth-in-blood-and-moonlight_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7di6tg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_rebirth-in-blood-and-moonlight_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7di6tg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_rebirth-in-blood-and-moonlight_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7di6tg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","